OL,5,G1900 Seven Worlds One Planet
OL,6,     FAntarctica: David Attenborough
OL,7,     Fnarrates a look at life on each
OL,8,     Fcontinent, revealing how each
OL,9,     Fdistinct land mass has shaped the
OL,10,     Fcreatures found there, beginning
OL,11,     Fwith Antarctica.
OL,12,G2000 Bangers & Cash
OL,13,     FMk1 Astra GTE/Morris
OL,14,     Fpickup/Lambretta Silver
OL,15,     FSpecial/Trojan: Sending Dave into
OL,16,     Fraptures, a Mark 1 Astra GTE.
OL,17,     FDerek heads to Norfolk to see a
OL,18,     F1964 Trojan and a 1966 Lambretta.
