OL,5,G2100 Dream Car Fixers
OL,6,     FTriumph Stag: Can Sheldon and Will
OL,7,     Fturn a 1976 Triumph Stag into a
OL,8,     Fdream car for retired head teacher
OL,9,     FSimon? They contend with a leaky
OL,10,     Fgearbox, a cracked dash and
OL,11,     Fworn-down seats.
OL,12,G2200 Bangers & Cash
OL,13,     FSunbeam Rapier: 100 motorbikes
OL,14,     Fcome in for auction from every era
OL,15,     Fof the 20th century. Also, the
OL,16,     Fteam assess a 1965 Vanden Plas
OL,17,     FPrincess with a four litre Rolls
OL,18,     FRoyce engine.
